<div class="detail-card prose">
  <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
  <p class="muted">This notice explains how SecureBook handles your personal data under Malaysia's Personal Data Protection Act 2010 (PDPA).</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Your name, email address and phone number</li>
    <li>Your appointments and any notes you add to them</li>
    <li>Security records such as login times and IP addresses</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not ask for your IC number, address or payment details.</p>

  <h2>Why we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To manage your appointments and contact you about them</li>
    <li>To protect your account and detect misuse of the system</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Who can see it</h2>
  <p>Only authorised clinic staff can view your bookings. We do not sell or share your data with third parties.</p>

  <h2>How we protect it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>All pages are served over HTTPS</li>
    <li>Passwords are stored as one-way hashes, never in plain text</li>
    <li>Access to records is restricted by role</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You can view and update your details on your profile page. To ask for a copy of your data, a correction or deletion of your account, contact the clinic.</p>
</div>

